{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_title", "source_sha256": "48dfd1a84b62cacc9caa115e9f1d0d31b4fe9d233d845c55be61875c8ff8f405", "ja": "憧れの舞台。だから…", "zh": "正因为是憧憬的舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c3a0c3c2bb67b7337a016f8109394e92c7b6e731d226c4d85284bb1e21496c6a", "ja": "次の公演のセンターに抜擢された静香。\n重圧に悩む彼女は、尊敬する千早にレッスン\nをみてもらうことに。本番に向けてのアドバ\nイスを受け、気負い過ぎていたことを受け入\nれた静香は、ステージを無事成功させる。", "zh": "静香被选为下次公演的Center。\n因身负重任而烦恼的她，在练习时得到她一直\n很尊敬的千早指点。静香接受了正式表演方面\n的建议，明白自己太求好心切之后，终于顺利\n完成表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a37aeaab9a28a62c5f7cd3ef22dcfa8b276aa0411bc82571ac04be0ba0e07061", "ja": "（静香の初センター公演が終わった。静香は\nすごい熱量で、観客を自分の歌に巻き込んだ……）", "zh": "（静香第一次的Center公演结束了。\n她以惊人的热情，让观众沉浸在自己的歌声里……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0c12faa0e775d4480e96c2b6927cdb3c94fe42c10a2b263ab7dcc5209c8d98b2", "ja": "（今までの静香のステージの中で、\n文句なしに一番の出来だったと思う！）", "zh": "（今天是静香至今为止的表演中，\n最可圈可点的一次！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "38ab66fcaa1218137643516377467731d8178ad0858287b91a1ffafea2fa688f", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……。", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "115b91d2372645c030a00c15c73b4105baac133b306f8ae11176e0092726a649", "ja": "お帰り、静香。\nお疲れさま！", "zh": "欢迎回来，静香。\n辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "33bd68fb163ce760de63025729d44ca8de14e1e5b81e94bd04ceca10eee40c09", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nあの、私……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n那个，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "30ec3ae5c099327d827b2e04cae56337497025daf1a590d6bc310ba61d98eff2", "ja": "静香ちゃ～ん！！！", "zh": "小静～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "0132c23a369bcfda736ad7c9ab14d95209aa1bb02b244a58d52f6b34ae5e8bbc", "ja": "きゃあっ！？\nみ、未来！　ちょっと……！？", "zh": "呀啊！？\n未、未来！等一下……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "9d3ed56fbad4781393f28a59080a213eb439a0a7ce7e1bd644730641b4511744", "ja": "よかったよぉ～、静香ちゃ～んっ！\nセンター、すっごくカッコよかった～っ！", "zh": "你真的是太棒了～小静～！\n你当Center的表现超级帅气～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "3aab64781fa68e56901a2c679a7ee4362d5a2067503f47435931ac5d5dff8e31", "ja": "あ、ありがとう……\nもう、どうして未来が泣いてるのよ？", "zh": "谢、谢谢你……\n真是的，为什么是未来你在哭啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "30d327214e0d19c7ab72d1fc0da9c374f38fcd1be0ddb97b4cd93194ac80146c", "ja": "うぅ、だって、だってぇ～。\n静香ちゃんが心配だったんだもん～っ。", "zh": "呜呜，因为、因为～\n我很担心小静啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "e3162ff1bb3036b84d4ae2c36b8f4dbf89a447db220b819ecbded4148257cd17", "ja": "未来さん、静香さんのこと、\nすごく心配してたんですよ。", "zh": "未来姊姊她呀，\n很担心静香姊姊喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "8956d676c17725d0f491a554b4cddaf42e69a7bc81b69cdf9fd402996852f38a", "ja": "えっ？\n私のことを……？", "zh": "咦？\n担心我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2b406b5246028fbeb8d5981d23ddd307609d271805fd9e4f98ec8b7688057e65", "ja": "だって静香ちゃん、レッスンばっかりで\n全然ヨユーなさそうだったし～。", "zh": "谁叫小静拚命一直练习，\n感觉超级紧张的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "2f162d1ff3e20b7f5e54a51a51a496796067a3ffa4c03658a4b80ef192d349a8", "ja": "うっ……。", "zh": "唔唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "efd42245435460c58ad8f7c20e2018c73efc548afdd73f387ef6e8001deee994", "ja": "邪魔しちゃいけないから、わたし達、あんまり\n遊びにも誘ったりしないようにしてたんだよ～？", "zh": "怕打扰到你就不好了，\n我们后来都尽量避免约你出去玩喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "b771caa91d3dce86c0778230fff2d3e184c947c82b81f3caf42f082604b8eec6", "ja": "そう、そうだったの……。\nごめんね、未来、翼、星梨花……ありがとう。", "zh": "原、原来是这样……\n抱歉，未来、翼、星梨花……谢谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "7764befa4ff02e5c6c3f9ec096fc86aa32b4f0f035632677e9666fc08d140095", "ja": "いえ！\n静香さんのセンター、すごく素敵でした！", "zh": "不用客气！\n静香姊姊当Center的表现，真的超级精彩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e61e310fc70817b6a6030a1baf8862104eb86af8bcb65afcd605c550e5435142", "ja": "未来の時とは雰囲気違ってたよね。\nいいな～、わたしもセンターやりた～い。", "zh": "和未来那时的气氛不一样呢。\n好羡慕喔～我也好想当Center～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1019_p", "source_sha256": "cf18d8251321eb701e9a67524fdb247ed65b7652c32f3ea6b97e712905944fca", "ja": "翼がちゃんとレッスンするなら、\nセンターにしてもいいけどな。", "zh": "翼愿意乖乖练习的话，\n就可以让你当Center喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5445616a559a706b5f42538d97ee637e26c61a2bf29790ed727baa0715626bcd", "ja": "え～～っ！？\nキツイのは、嫌ですよ～っ。", "zh": "咦～～！？\n可是我不喜欢那么辛苦啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1583f0c5417f8c0e1528293080659448e566879588a86b6a0e10cb2cdf76e016", "ja": "やれやれ、センター以外のメンバーの方が元気かもな。\n……静香、さっき何か言いかけてなかったか？", "zh": "真是的，Center以外的成员们都更有活力呢。\n……静香，你刚刚是不是想说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "0de1b0bd910798d8912ddb2f2f299d1a00c997382ee3c78f1d5d0cf51b64e98c", "ja": "あっ。あれは、その……。\nあの、ええと……。", "zh": "啊，那是，那个……\n那个，就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1026_p", "source_sha256": "d0964446c94733da4138ced8a7cce3252d3c7a1486916cd8ec2959af7bfdd4d3", "ja": "？\nなんだ、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "？\n怎么了，有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "a5777e12ef0767f5301f6166596ad05212c43350bb1068623a00f8a9e3e32fa0", "ja": "私、その……\nき、緊張とか、しませんでしたからっ！", "zh": "我，那个……\n一、一点都不觉得紧张！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1028_p", "source_sha256": "402e4542437fe3d59cf73c1042efebd01ddde0df7b94591e33326a61dc3f59af", "ja": "なんだ、そのことか。うんうん、\n千早の前ほど緊張しなかったんだろ？", "zh": "什么啊，原来是在说这件事啊。\n嗯嗯，没有比在千早面前唱歌来得紧张吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "a29bd27f25def5b1bf607ac2418b9490cd6ed2b67980efd1826ee46d664d8678", "ja": "！\n……も、もう！　また、そういうことを……！", "zh": "！\n……讨、讨厌！你又提起那件事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1030_002chi", "source_sha256": "e372190af79811e45fd4ff75928c5253c654a44a5cea2c7bbdeec1357e61c2a7", "ja": "最上さん。", "zh": "最上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "8994530ae32a3ea836f5c3466e4c82b36ac62dac936e74a686c18c771bf06efe", "ja": "えっ？\n……ち、千早さん！？", "zh": "咦？\n……千、千早！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1032_002chi", "source_sha256": "004b44ea209721f6f01660c38932a8eec1522ebfe53f69f1e94ef11c9fcf14bf", "ja": "初センター、お疲れさま。\nとてもいいステージだったわ。", "zh": "第一次当Center，辛苦你了。\n是场很棒的表演喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "c10e8e676a8a06a8ea0f311ac0feef28a558dad40a2c4c6d50d98b15950defb4", "ja": "えっ！？\nあの、見て……！？", "zh": "咦！？\n请问，你也来看了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1034_002chi", "source_sha256": "d698962e8576012db2d9abf510cb8419a8aee0ef0cced89e094d9d01536921a3", "ja": "もちろん。\n裏で聞かせてもらっていたの。", "zh": "当然。\n我在后台听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1035_002chi", "source_sha256": "249bbe05dbcd45e383eef84209085aee86a6de337264bafb8f23183ad16b9837", "ja": "とても素敵だった……。\nできれば客席で、ゆっくり聞きたかったくらい。", "zh": "你唱得非常好……可以的话，\n我还真希望能坐在观众席，好好听你唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "728bcce35144dd45565d1c14700797fa814535172b6d40339fe3979e21a61442", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます……！\n千早さんに、アドバイスしてもらったおかげです！", "zh": "谢、谢谢你……！\n这都是多亏了你给我的建议！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1037_002chi", "source_sha256": "7e321c621f91450b410ae56e3e424c05914e6e25d8859b3ae69c13a352890fbc", "ja": "私は何も。\n最上さんが努力をした結果だと思う。", "zh": "我没做什么。\n这都是你努力的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "084fd96b3eed28997af44a36204d6b240323812ec373bc171f6f4d3707cc8906", "ja": "千早さん……。", "zh": "千早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1039_002chi", "source_sha256": "e2842a68f5ada16a01712fbec968868b5d08c407191f82f63f20aafdc2379ee5", "ja": "それじゃ、私はこれで。", "zh": "那么，我就先告辞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "ca164e20a59dbfbbd71c53efd33539458f5854ed6b74c3a2bac9d2416b9816b4", "ja": "えっ？\nあの、打ち上げは……！？", "zh": "咦？\n那个，你不参加庆功宴吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1041_002chi", "source_sha256": "230b18189e5e837e6d90ceacb172abc66c8fbfe3799354cacdda4598f295597d", "ja": "ありがとう。でも、今日はまだ何もしていなくて。\nだから早く帰って自主練習しないと。", "zh": "谢谢你的邀请。但我今天都还没什么练习，\n所以我得早点回去自主练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1042_002chi", "source_sha256": "81a09f1f79e4d680dd9c8c4a93133226998d264144ae1545bf222e10f143606e", "ja": "最上さんに、負けていられないわ……。\nふふっ。", "zh": "我可不能输给最上你呢……\n呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_002_1043_se", "source_sha256": "ec1af790cbe5a717d390a701e0d39fdb8669efd3b376f0195d6a366da2749d27", "ja": "パタン……", "zh": "磅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
